units lj
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 random 100 12345 box
mass 1 1.0 

pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5

neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

velocity all create 1.0 87287
fix 1 all nve

timestep 0.005
thermo 100
run 1000
